rição</h2><div class="space-y-4"><div data-xblox-safe-rich-content="v30.17-rich-visual-allowlist" data-xblox-safe-rich-mode="product" class="space-y-3"><div id="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas"><article class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-title"><header class="mb-5 rounded-2xl border border-blue-400/30 bg-blue-950/60 p-5 md:p-7"><span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-blue-400/40 bg-blue-400/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase text-blue-200">Frutas Míticas no Inventário</span><h2 class="mt-6 mb-3 text-xl font-black text-foreground text-2xl font-black text-foreground" id="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-title">🎲 Conta Blox Fruits: 2 Frutas Míticas Aleatórias (Garantidas) + Godhuman + Level Max</h2><p class="my-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Sorte em dobro! Comece no topo com <strong class="font-bold text-foreground">Level Máximo (2800)</strong>, <strong class="font-bold text-foreground">Godhuman</strong> e um inventário recheado com <strong class="font-bold text-foreground">2 Frutas Míticas Aleatórias GARANTIDAS</strong>.</p></header><ul class="my-3 ml-6 list-disc space-y-1 grid list-none grid-cols-2 gap-2 p-0 md:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Destaques do produto"><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-3 text-center"><span class="mb-1 block text-xl" aria-hidden="true">🏆</span><span class="block text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Level Max (2800)</span></li><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-3 text-center"><span class="mb-1 block text-xl" aria-hidden="true">👊</span><span class="block text-sm font-bold text-foreground">Godhuman (Deus Humano)</span></li><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-3 text-center"><span class="mb-1 block text-xl" aria-hidden="true">✨</span><span class="block text-sm font-bold text-foreground">2x Míticas Garantidas</span></li></ul><section class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 md:p-5 border-blue-400/30 bg-blue-400/10" aria-labelledby="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-entrega"><h2 class="mt-6 mb-3 text-xl font-black text-foreground text-xl font-bold text-foreground" id="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-entrega">ENTREGA AUTOMÁTICA</h2><p class="my-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Comprou → recebeu na hora na página do pedido e também no e-mail.</p></section><section class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 md:p-5" aria-labelledby="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-s0"><h2 class="mt-6 mb-3 text-xl font-black text-foreground text-xl font-bold text-foreground" id="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-s0">O que vem na conta</h2><ul class="my-3 ml-6 list-disc space-y-1 grid list-none gap-3 p-0"><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border border-blue-300/40 bg-blue-300/10" aria-hidden="true">🏆</span><div><span class="block font-bold text-foreground">Level Máximo garantido</span><span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Pronta para o SEA 3 (Terceiro Mar) e conteúdo endgame.</span></div></li><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border border-green-300/40 bg-green-300/10" aria-hidden="true">✨</span><div><span class="block font-bold text-foreground">2x Frutas Míticas Garantidas (Aleatórias)</span><span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">O inventário conterá pelo menos 2 frutas de tier Mítico (Ex: Kitsune, Leopard, Dragon, Dough, Spirit, etc). As frutas específicas são surpresa!</span></div></li><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border border-purple-300/40 bg-purple-300/10" aria-hidden="true">👊</span><div><span class="block font-bold text-foreground">Godhuman desbloqueado e pronto para equipar</span><span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Um dos estilos mais fortes do jogo.</span></div></li><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border border-red-300/40 bg-red-300/10" aria-hidden="true">⚔️</span><div><span class="block font-bold text-foreground">Itens &amp; bônus aleatórios</span><span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Pode vir com espadas/acessórios raros e outras frutas surpresa (varia por conta).</span></div></li></ul></section><section class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/60 p-4 md:p-5 border-blue-400/30 bg-blue-400/10" aria-labelledby="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-s1"><h2 class="mt-6 mb-3 text-xl font-black text-foreground text-xl font-bold text-foreground" id="xbx-level-max-godhuman-2-frutas-s1">Segurança / Full acesso</h2><ul class="my-3 ml-6 list-disc space-y-1 grid list-none gap-3 p-0"><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border border-blue-300/40 bg-blue-300/10" aria-hidden="true">✅</span><div><span class="block font-bold text-foreground">Conta 100% sua</span><span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Você recebe <strong class="font-bold text-foreground">usuário e senha</strong>. Ao logar, troque a senha e vincule seu e-mail.</span></div></li><li class="leading-7 text-muted-foreground flex items-start gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border border-green-300/40 bg-green-300/10" aria-hidden="true">✅</span><div><span class="block font-bold text-foreground">Sem travas pra você</span><span class="block text-sm text-muted-foreground">Entregue pronta para assumir o controle e configurar do seu jeito (recomendado: 